# Copy to .env for local dev (points at the backend running via `npm run dev`
# in server/). For production/Android builds, use .env.production instead,
# pointing at the deployed Render service.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:4000

# MSG91 (https://msg91.com) OTP Widget credentials — the app calls MSG91
# directly from the browser (see src/lib/msg91Client.ts) instead of through
# our backend, since Render's outbound IP gets intermittently blocked by
# MSG91's widget anti-abuse layer. Same widgetId/tokenAuth pair used to live
# on the Render service; get the real values from the MSG91 dashboard or the
# Render environment tab. These are meant to be client-embeddable for this
# MSG91 product (unlike an account Authkey, which must stay server-only).
VITE_MSG91_WIDGET_ID=
VITE_MSG91_TOKEN_AUTH=
